{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "section_title", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {}, "render": {"prefix": "\\section{", "suffix": "}\n\\label{section-fppf-local-source}"}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:71d3ee730dca71c1c0b8fdb96699772f8c1ddc9b587d1062100d94ebe622867a", "source_text": "Properties of morphisms local in the fppf topology on the source", "source_text_hash": "sha256:da99ce0b2fdcd07146932888c890002fbeed8283f641e89840d5e2513d622b8c", "unit_id": "tag:036M:title"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f2e4f47909a1ec88fed80da415ef13a655f63cc9b25560764c8987ebacf68f6b", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nHere are some properties of morphisms that are fppf local on the source.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9d17101264d3a983936b73cd43eabf8519c4927ab6d490bfa30ff37fbcc6dc9f", "unit_id": "tag:036M:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f)=$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-locally-finite-presentation-fppf-local-source}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ab35b345eca890fe8040be42a5f3825cfdbd2d4cf600ac61d7c02fb30bea35e6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:003098221f083c6892e13df9630383bb4b4c1def14f0def1b04ad117bbc62d13", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is locally of finite presentation''\nis fppf local on the source.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:b6a7b33adf8502b9979cb8d76842e63134d75d6464ccab4ef1d83b3b7b8deb29", "unit_id": "tag:036N:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-locally-finite-presentation-characterize}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-composition-finite-presentation}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-properties-morphisms-local-source}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-flat-finitely-presented-permanence-algebra}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f466933d4d96c2b295495b5a3038e726ba4a827c08ab224cfb4cd8b4b4377175", "source_text": "Being locally of finite presentation is Zariski local on the source\nand the target, see Morphisms,\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nIt is a property which is preserved under composition, see\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nThis proves\n(1), (2) and (3) of Lemma <REF_0003>.\nThe final condition (4) is\nLemma <REF_0004>. Hence we win.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:affdf6316061112ea77a6e43b65010c8d84548b3466c09c9ce1917d7cd498866", "unit_id": "tag:036N:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f)=$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-locally-finite-type-fppf-local-source}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ab35b345eca890fe8040be42a5f3825cfdbd2d4cf600ac61d7c02fb30bea35e6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:a2f057b605038e0647e74a75eae7a91c4b5b4876a3059ac6350ab5780da099c0", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is locally of finite type''\nis fppf local on the source.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:64c42d616869cfeabfd74c765de8cf4563906fece633a53109092b966cb55fcb", "unit_id": "tag:036O:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-locally-finite-type-characterize}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-composition-finite-type}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-finite-presentation-finite-type}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{lemma-properties-morphisms-local-source}", "REF_0005": "\\ref{lemma-finite-type-local-source-fppf-algebra}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:f7c80692d60890764a507f7d8af6a4e06cbc3f207fcb88a77e429e45525ba95a", "source_text": "Being locally of finite type is Zariski local on the source\nand the target, see Morphisms,\nLemma <REF_0001>.\nIt is a property which is preserved under composition, see\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0002>, and\na flat morphism locally of finite presentation is locally of finite type, see\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0003>.\nThis proves\n(1), (2) and (3) of Lemma <REF_0004>.\nThe final condition (4) is\nLemma <REF_0005>. Hence we win.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:7a0e3f84b317fa5b00202603bcbcfbead6ec3745ae80cf1fa1e306ad71054120", "unit_id": "tag:036O:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f)=$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-open-fppf-local-source}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ab35b345eca890fe8040be42a5f3825cfdbd2d4cf600ac61d7c02fb30bea35e6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:30215878563e2d8f27e616e6c966d6378573aeced09d9fc47f1ec8dafb3431ef", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is open''\nis fppf local on the source.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9bf53e45d0b7897791deedeef8b32c4ed227e7b23ea4cd3f5243c27b196141d5", "unit_id": "tag:036P:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-composition-open}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-fppf-open}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-properties-morphisms-local-source}", "REF_0004": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-fpqc-quotient-topology}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:1411c15173d8a4c227613715cc4a6b12682358b700ba476bea5b3636285969ba", "source_text": "Being an open morphism is clearly Zariski local on the source and the target.\nIt is a property which is preserved under composition, see\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0001>, and\na flat morphism of finite presentation is open, see\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0002>\nThis proves\n(1), (2) and (3) of Lemma <REF_0003>.\nThe final condition (4) follows from\nMorphisms, Lemma <REF_0004>.\nHence we win.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:a47161a6c40462a4ff02eefffa8a4acc309178130a5c543433ac4cccce9d9e7c", "unit_id": "tag:036P:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$\\mathcal{P}(f)=$", "MATH_0002": "$f$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-universally-open-fppf-local-source}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ab35b345eca890fe8040be42a5f3825cfdbd2d4cf600ac61d7c02fb30bea35e6", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:e0695dea176a4df85f47b23e920bfbd0f9470a6fbe438d9fe89a65d81178cad5", "source_text": "The property <MATH_0001>``<MATH_0002> is universally open''\nis fppf local on the source.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:0983e855b105e2cce480fc425b9dd3be1aee57456071a0ff1c94f41bfb665245", "unit_id": "tag:036Q:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "036M", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to Y$", "MATH_0002": "$\\{X_i \\to X\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0003": "$f_i : X_i \\to X$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$f_i$", "MATH_0006": "$f$", "MATH_0007": "$f_i$", "MATH_0008": "$X_i \\to X$", "MATH_0009": "$f_i$", "MATH_0010": "$Y' \\to Y$", "MATH_0011": "$X' = Y' \\times_Y X$", "MATH_0012": "$X'_i = Y' \\times_Y X_i$", "MATH_0013": "$\\{X_i' \\to X'\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0014": "$f'_i : X_i' \\to Y'$", "MATH_0015": "$f' : X' \\to Y'$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-fppf-open}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{morphisms-lemma-composition-open}", "REF_0003": "\\ref{lemma-open-fppf-local-source}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:29ee2db8159b68f8cfc391fb3552ea6cf39a1e6cefd5de329e22f7a7230579e5", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:cdf5b4096b9b07dfc6133efaf977403a4222dfeb4a05034c36795cc140a8ff7b", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nLet <MATH_0002> be an fppf covering.\nDenote <MATH_0003> the compositions.\nWe have to show that <MATH_0004> is universally open if and only if\neach <MATH_0005> is universally open. If <MATH_0006> is universally open,\nthen also each <MATH_0007> is universally open since the maps\n<MATH_0008> are universally open and compositions\nof universally open morphisms are universally open\n(Morphisms, Lemmas <REF_0001>\nand <REF_0002>).\nConversely, assume each <MATH_0009> is universally open.\nLet <MATH_0010> be a morphism of schemes.\nDenote <MATH_0011> and <MATH_0012>.\nNote that <MATH_0013> is an fppf covering also.\nThe morphisms <MATH_0014> are open by assumption.\nHence by the Lemma <REF_0003>\nabove we conclude that <MATH_0015> is open as desired.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:665c9e832489e7bf82616ba59e31e95e447e2a8d5f7877595f50ff611237220f", "unit_id": "tag:036Q:proof"}
